$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=holidchain  LOC_AFTER=?

* The chain from X to Y in N steps: a holomorphic function vanishing on the disc of radius R / 2 about a point X of the nested rectangle vanishes on the disc of radius R / 2 about every point X + ( k / N ) ( Y - X ) , 0 <_ k <_ N , when the step ( abs ` ( Y - X ) ) / N is less than R / 2.

